If there's no win/loss, you know, when a win or loss happens, there's a certain sense of tension, like wanting something attached to the dice roll.

699
01:02:32,832 --> 01:02:36,192
なんもないとね、まあただの運ゲーになっちゃって、そうそう、あってなるだけだから。
If there's nothing, well, it just becomes a game of pure luck, and you just go "oh", so...

